{
  "duration": 51.147166666666664,
  "cues": [
    {
      "scene": "hook",
      "text": "How does ChatGPT actually know what to say?",
      "start": 0.3,
      "end": 3.223708333333333,
      "file": "audio/line-0.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "hook",
      "text": "It doesn't look up a finished answer.",
      "start": 3.453708333333333,
      "end": 5.496583333333334,
      "file": "audio/line-1.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "tokens",
      "text": "First, your message becomes tokens: small pieces of text.",
      "start": 5.796583333333333,
      "end": 9.448916666666667,
      "file": "audio/line-2.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "network",
      "text": "Inside a neural network, attention connects each piece to relevant context.",
      "start": 9.678916666666666,
      "end": 14.368666666666666,
      "file": "audio/line-3.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "attention",
      "text": "Take: The cat sat on the...",
      "start": 14.598666666666666,
      "end": 16.22758333333333,
      "file": "audio/line-4.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "attention",
      "text": "Mat fits better than moon.",
      "start": 16.457583333333332,
      "end": 18.1555,
      "file": "audio/line-5.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "prediction",
      "text": "The model assigns probabilities to possible next tokens, then selects one.",
      "start": 18.3855,
      "end": 22.830416666666668,
      "file": "audio/line-6.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "generation",
      "text": "Add it to the text. Run the network again.",
      "start": 23.060416666666665,
      "end": 25.525041666666667,
      "file": "audio/line-7.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "generation",
      "text": "That's a response, built one piece at a time.",
      "start": 25.755041666666667,
      "end": 28.235583333333334,
      "file": "audio/line-8.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "training",
      "text": "But where did those abilities come from?",
      "start": 28.615583333333333,
      "end": 30.762041666666665,
      "file": "audio/line-9.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "training",
      "text": "Training adjusted billions of internal settings, learning patterns from examples.",
      "start": 30.992041666666665,
      "end": 35.81829166666667,
      "file": "audio/line-10.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "inference",
      "text": "Answering uses those settings. It doesn't retrain the model with every reply.",
      "start": 36.048291666666664,
      "end": 40.62745833333334,
      "file": "audio/line-11.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "payoff",
      "text": "From that simple loop emerge explanations, code, and ideas.",
      "start": 40.927458333333334,
      "end": 44.523875,
      "file": "audio/line-12.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "payoff",
      "text": "But a likely next word isn't a guarantee of truth.",
      "start": 44.753875,
      "end": 47.52220833333333,
      "file": "audio/line-13.wav"
    },
    {
      "scene": "end",
      "text": "Powerful prediction. Not perfect knowledge.",
      "start": 47.752208333333336,
      "end": 50.147166666666664,
      "file": "audio/line-14.wav"
    }
  ]
}